  "html": "<p dir=\"auto\"><span>We can all agree that potatoes is the best food out there. They can be made into chips, fries, baked potatoes, Fries, latkes, FRIES! As you can tell I really like fries. However, sometimes you can't just hop into the nearest McDonald's drive through. As I was scrolling TikTok, as one does, I found this delicious crispy potatoes recipe that I just had to try out. It was made by @franziee v and they are a great alternative to fries! I did put my own spin on this and changed the seasonings and instead of deep frying them, I air fried them (which makes them even healthier!). Another plus side to these potatoes is that you know exactly what's going into them! Are you 100% sure that McDonald's isn't adding some secret chemicals into your fries? Well, you can be positive that these potatoes don't have any! By the way, these are a great snack to share with two! Ok, enough rambling, it's time to make some crispy potatoes!</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 1: Peel and wash three potatoes. I recommend peeling a little bit then rinsing the potato and then continuing peeling. For some reason, when I was peeling the potatoes and I did that, it made the process sooooo much easier for me.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_b30d6b2da35040df964f85cbb623c5aa~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_b30d6b2da35040df964f85cbb623c5aa~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 2: Chop off the ends. This makes the potatoes be more uniform in shape by the end.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_695c82edd18b420988465b6e9c56aff8~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_695c82edd18b420988465b6e9c56aff8~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 3: Cut 3 to 4 slices per potato. I preferred mine thicker so I did 3 slices.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_508de23886be41e0a5c99e33610043fe~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_508de23886be41e0a5c99e33610043fe~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 4: Cut vertically. </span><strong><span>But not all the way down!</span></strong><span> We don't want them to fall apart!</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_10c0e2d3173e437596e260bad2f5b09b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4032,h_3024,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_10c0e2d3173e437596e260bad2f5b09b~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 5: Cut diagonally. </span><strong><span>Make sure you flip the potatoes AND don't cut all the way down! </span></strong><span>I made the mistake of not flipping for some of them and some of them fell apart.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_c5d6e1f7213b403fabe4200d0c291738~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_c5d6e1f7213b403fabe4200d0c291738~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 6: Preheat air fryer to 350 degrees/medium heat. You can also use a deep fryer or an oven. </span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_d979a3be06124308b36d777cb5f3978e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4032,h_3024,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_d979a3be06124308b36d777cb5f3978e~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span> Step 7: While it's preheating, make some sauce! You can use whichever sauce you like! I made mine with ketchup and mayonnaise. I also topped it with parsley.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_79e8b16b01f9490a971effd24711c781~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_79e8b16b01f9490a971effd24711c781~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 8: Once its done preheating, drizzle the air fryer with oil and put the potatoes in. Make sure none of the potatoes are overlapping.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_e1df0839ceda432f9a84607f8d75bd31~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4032,h_3024,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_e1df0839ceda432f9a84607f8d75bd31~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 9: Cook for 15 - 30 minutes. I originally put it in for 15 minutes but it wasn't as crispy as I liked so I put it in for an extra 10 minutes. It's up to your personal preference.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_2145966b85064151819ee8db5a391fbf~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_4032,h_3024,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_2145966b85064151819ee8db5a391fbf~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 10: Once its done cooking drizzle with more oil and top with salt. The oil will allow the salt to stick on the potatoes.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_8c4989af0f504410bbfd513ba025aa1e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_8c4989af0f504410bbfd513ba025aa1e~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 11: Put on a plate and top with parsley.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_208db9424a424d99b5f305de79099a90~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_208db9424a424d99b5f305de79099a90~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Step 12: Enjoy!</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_4bd8fef3f969412589aad7e3992c044b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3024,h_4032,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_4bd8fef3f969412589aad7e3992c044b~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>"
}
